              "text": "Sciēns hoc fēcit, nōn imprūdēns. He did this knowingly, not by mistake."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "sciēns, scientis, the present participle of sciō: knowing, on purpose. With the genitive, skilled in: bellī sciēns."
